From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 04:12:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Re-rest a websocket protect cancel through the existing
 sweep.

op ws-replace continues one replacement after poly-worker has already cancelled. It uses the same chain cap, reconcile, and create-unknown adoption as the 1.5s sweep, and it will not place a second order if that sweep won the claim.
